<p id="S8.I2.i2.p1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="S8.I2.i2.p1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">be a </span><math id="S8.I2.i2.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="G" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>G</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">G</annotation></semantics></math><span id="S8.I2.i2.p1.2.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">-equivariant morphism of Novikov groups. Let </span><math id="S8.I2.i2.p1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tilde{\mathbb{F}}_{1},\ldots,\tilde{\mathbb{F}}_{m}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝔽</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝔽</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>m</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tilde{\mathbb{F}}_{1},\ldots,\tilde{\mathbb{F}}_{m}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="S8.I2.i2.p1.2.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic"> be </span><math id="S8.I2.i2.p1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbb{\Pi}_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_mathvariant_double-struck" mathvariant="double-struck">Π</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbb{\Pi}_{i}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="S8.I2.i2.p1.2.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">-equivariant flow categories enriched in </span><math id="S8.I2.i2.p1.m8" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="{}_{\lfloor}\underline{\smash{\bf dOrb}}_{\rm rig}^{\rm NC}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">⌊</mo></msub><munder accentunder="true"><mi>𝐝𝐎𝐫𝐛</mi><mo stretchy="true">¯</mo></munder><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>rig</mi></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>NC</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{}_{\lfloor}\underline{\smash{\bf dOrb}}_{\rm rig}^{\rm NC}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="S8.I2.i2.p1.2.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic"> such that the weak flow category </span><math id="