</div>
<div id="S12.Thmthm3" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_prop">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="S12.Thmthm3.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Proposition 12.3</span></span><span id="S12.Thmthm3.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">.</span></h6>
<div id="S12.Thmthm3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="S12.Thmthm3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S12.Thmthm3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Under the assumption of Theorem <a href="#Thmthma16" title="Theorem P. ‣ 12.2. Multimodules and homotopies ‣ 12. Main Theorems on AMS Lifts ‣ Part II GEOMETRIC FLOW CATEGORIES, BIMODULES, AND HOMOTOPIES ‣ Integral Hamiltonian Floer Theory: Foundations" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">P</span></a>, fix an outercollaring width.</span></p>
</div>
