<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="S14.I3.i3.p1.2" class="ltx_p">Hence there is a well-defined composition</p>
<table id="S14.Ex16" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="S14.Ex16.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="M_{d_{j}}^{{\mathbb{f}}_{j}}\times M_{d}^{\mathbb{h}}\times M_{d^{\prime}}^{{\mathbb{f}}^{\prime}}\to M_{d_{j}+d+d^{\prime}}^{\mathbb{h}}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>M</mi><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><msub><mi>𝕗</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></msubsup><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><msubsup><mi>M</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>𝕙</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><msubsup><mi>M</mi><msup><mi>d</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><msup><mi>𝕗</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><msubsup><mi>M</mi><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>d</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></mrow><mi>𝕙</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">M_{d_{j}}^{{\mathbb{f}}_{j}}\times M_{d}^{\mathbb{h}}\times M_{d^{\prime}}^{{\mathbb{f}}^{\prime}}\to M_{d_{j}+d+d^{\prime}}^{\mathbb{h}}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div></li>
<li id="S14.I3.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(4)</span> 
