<p id="S26.SS2.SSS3.p2.2" class="ltx_p">The objects in this diagram are all modules over <math id="S26.SS2.SSS3.p2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Lambda_{{\bf K}_{\sf p}}^{\Pi}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi mathvariant="normal">Λ</mi><msub><mi>𝐊</mi><mi>𝗉</mi></msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Π</mi></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Lambda_{{\bf K}_{\sf p}}^{\Pi}</annotation></semantics></math>. As the quasi-Frobenius map respects equivariant chain homotopies, after passing to cohomology, one obtains the commutative diagram</p>
